{"video": "chocolate", "titulo": "Como surgiu o chocolate?", "fps": 30, "durationInFrames": 1800, "durationSeconds": 60.0, "engine": "elevenlabs", "voz": {"estilo": "documentario", "ritmo": 1.0}, "scenes": [{"id": "gancho", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 0, "endFrame": 98, "lines": [{"text": "Sabia que o chocolate já foi dinheiro?", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 75, "words": [{"text": "Sabia", "startFrame": 7, "endFrame": 16}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 19, "endFrame": 21}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 22, "endFrame": 23}, {"text": "chocolate", "startFrame": 24, "endFrame": 43}, {"text": "já", "startFrame": 44, "endFrame": 50}, {"text": "foi", "startFrame": 51, "endFrame": 55}, {"text": "dinheiro?", "startFrame": 57, "endFrame": 75}]}]}, {"id": "origem", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 98, "endFrame": 395, "lines": [{"text": "Mais de três mil anos atrás, povos do México e da América Central já usavam o cacau.", "startFrame": 120, "endFrame": 271, "words": [{"text": "Mais", "startFrame": 120, "endFrame": 128}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 130, "endFrame": 135}, {"text": "três", "startFrame": 137, "endFrame": 142}, {"text": "mil", "startFrame": 147, "endFrame": 152}, {"text": "anos", "startFrame": 155, "endFrame": 159}, {"text": "atrás,", "startFrame": 162, "endFrame": 176}, {"text": "povos", "startFrame": 177, "endFrame": 185}, {"text": "do", "startFrame": 188, "endFrame": 190}, {"text": "México", "startFrame": 192, "endFrame": 202}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 203, "endFrame": 204}, {"text": "da", "startFrame": 206, "endFrame": 207}, {"text": "América", "startFrame": 209, "endFrame": 219}, {"text": "Central", "startFrame": 221, "endFrame": 233}, {"text": "já", "startFrame": 236, "endFrame": 239}, {"text": "usavam", "startFrame": 240, "endFrame": 252}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 254, "endFrame": 255}, {"text": "cacau.", "startFrame": 257, "endFrame": 271}]}, {"text": "Ele nasce numa fruta assim, cheia de sementes.", "startFrame": 282, "endFrame": 372, "words": [{"text": "Ele", "startFrame": 282, "endFrame": 287}, {"text": "nasce", "startFrame": 289, "endFrame": 297}, {"text": "numa", "startFrame": 299, "endFrame": 306}, {"text": "fruta", "startFrame": 307, "endFrame": 316}, {"text": "assim,", "startFrame": 321, "endFrame": 340}, {"text": "cheia", "startFrame": 342, "endFrame": 349}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 351, "endFrame": 352}, {"text": "sementes.", "startFrame": 354, "endFrame": 372}]}]}, {"id": "maias", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 395, "endFrame": 640, "lines": [{"text": "Os maias faziam uma bebida amarga e espumante… às vezes com pimenta!", "startFrame": 417, "endFrame": 559, "words": [{"text": "Os", "startFrame": 417, "endFrame": 422}, {"text": "maias", "startFrame": 424, "endFrame": 434}, {"text": "faziam", "startFrame": 436, "endFrame": 448}, {"text": "uma", "startFrame": 451, "endFrame": 453}, {"text": "bebida", "startFrame": 457, "endFrame": 465}, {"text": "amarga", "startFrame": 470, "endFrame": 482}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 483, "endFrame": 484}, {"text": "espumante…", "startFrame": 487, "endFrame": 511}, {"text": "às", "startFrame": 513, "endFrame": 517}, {"text": "vezes", "startFrame": 518, "endFrame": 527}, {"text": "com", "startFrame": 530, "endFrame": 532}, {"text": "pimenta!", "startFrame": 535, "endFrame": 559}]}, {"text": "Nada de docinho!", "startFrame": 570, "endFrame": 617, "words": [{"text": "Nada", "startFrame": 589, "endFrame": 596}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 598, "endFrame": 599}, {"text": "docinho!", "startFrame": 601, "endFrame": 617}]}]}, {"id": "dinheiro", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 640, "endFrame": 914, "lines": [{"text": "Já os astecas usavam as sementes de cacau como moeda!", "startFrame": 662, "endFrame": 762, "words": [{"text": "Já", "startFrame": 662, "endFrame": 667}, {"text": "os", "startFrame": 670, "endFrame": 672}, {"text": "astecas", "startFrame": 674, "endFrame": 689}, {"text": "usavam", "startFrame": 691, "endFrame": 701}, {"text": "as", "startFrame": 703, "endFrame": 